# Rust/Cargo artifacts
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally committed. This crate builds a deployed
# cdylib/wasm artifact and depends (via soroban-env-host 22.1.3) on the
# open-ended `ed25519-dalek = ">=2.0.0"` range; without a pinned lock a fresh
# resolve picks the incompatible 3.0 line and `cargo test` fails to compile.

# WASM build artifacts
*.wasm
*.wasm.old

